        "effect": "Each creature in the area sees the lantern room transform into a battlefield, where Ekriathe and her allies battle a force of human soldiers. Each creature takes 4d12+26 mental damage (DC 33 basic Will save). A creature that fails or critically fails the save believes it has been transported backward in time and can\u2019t willingly leave the lantern room until the haunt is disabled. An affected creature can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns to end this effect. The haunt then rolls initiative.",
